 label "Scene (l) -- small-CoC transition\n\nCheck: a shallow depth ramp crossing 0-2.5px CoC must show no chatter or banding at the sharp-path / kernel-LUT-step transitions.\n\nSame ground plane as scene (g), at a 40x shallower slope. Three DeepCDefocus branches, depth_layers=8/16/64 (16 is the shipping default) -- a bucket-composite artefact moves with K, a sharp-path/LUT artefact does not. The radial/diagonal ramp variants and the CoC-field-extremum check are not reproduced here."
